# Components

Canonical examples: `@src/components/Toggle.tsx`, `@src/components/DataStreamRow.tsx`, `@src/components/Sidebar.tsx`.

## Structure

- Default-export the component function (`export default function Toggle`)
- Export shared types and static data from the same file when they are only used with that UI (`DataStream`, `DATA_STREAMS`)
- Keep `"use client"` off unless the file uses hooks or browser-only APIs. Sidebar needs it for `usePathname`; Toggle and TopBar do not
- Import siblings with `@/components/...`, not relative `../`

## Reuse before adding files

- On/off switches: `@src/components/Toggle.tsx` — required `aria-label`, optional `size` (`sm` | `md`) and `defaultChecked`. Preserve the peer-focus-visible ring on the track
- Weather/nav icons: Material Symbols in a `<span>`, not a new icon component unless several call sites need the same wrapper
- Navigation: add entries to the `links` array in Sidebar (desktop aside + mobile bottom bar share it)

## Props and a11y

- Prefer a small typed props alias at the top of the file (`ToggleProps`) over inline object types when there is more than one prop
- Interactive controls need an accessible name (`aria-label` or visible text)
- Do not convert presentational MVP widgets into fully controlled forms unless the task asks for state
